WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:48.290
Someone once said:

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:55.290
There is a boiling, bubbling magma gratin 
in a natural volcanic crater oven....

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:59.400
The Magmacaroni Gratin!

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:04.940
There are pumpkins so sticky sweet, 
they taste almost like pudding!

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:07.470
The Pumpudding!

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:10.040
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:14.350
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:19.380
Sunny, one of the Four Heavenly 
Kings, had captured a Regal Mammoth,

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.620
but he learned that it 
was simply a lost child.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:24.760
So Toriko and the others headed 
toward the Regal Highlands

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.960
Entrance to the Highlands - Regal Wall

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.960
Regal Highlands

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.960
Devils' Playground

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.960
Black Grass Plains

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.960
White Forest

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.960
Mushroom Wood

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.960
Ancient Marsh

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.960
No. 1 Gourmet Laboratory

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:27.530
to capture a fully grown Regal Mammoth.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:31.100
There, they were attacked 
by three Rock Drums,

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:35.430
but their attack was repelled using 
Sunny's technique, Dining Kitchen.

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:40.070
Elsewhere, the Gourmet Corp. is 
also aiming for the Regal Mammoth,

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:43.140
and a GT Robot controlled by Starjun

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:46.810
has joined the other 3 in the No. 1 Biotope!

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:54.320
The Gourmet Hunter Toriko has captured 
that rare delicacy, Rock Drum!

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:57.520
Sunny, are you sure you don't 
want any of the Rock Drum's meat?

00:02:57.520 --> 00:03:00.220
I have no need for that 
non-nutritious looking meat.

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:02.590
I've decided to bring 
this shell back with me.

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:04.930
Back? What about the Regal Mammoth?

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:06.060
I have more important things to do!

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:09.270
I must get this to beautiful craftsmen,

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:12.400
and get them to turn it into 
beautiful marble, without delay!

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:15.210
You're so self-centered, Brother!

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:20.410
A R-Rock Drum?

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:23.850
The one Sunny blasted 
away first has come back!

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:28.420
Right, the one I used BF on! 
And it seems just dandy!

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:31.490
I forgot to actually Knock it.

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:53.180
Regal Isle Dash! Search for the Jewel Meat!

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:05.790
Hair Net!

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:10.190
Thank you very much, Sunny-san...

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:17.440
You do not land beautifully.

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:21.570
But, the Rock Drum <i>is</i> Capture Level 27...

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:23.410
I shouldn't have underestimated it.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:27.080
I'm surprised that we flew all 
the way to the Mushroom Wood.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.050
M-Mushroom Wood?

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:31.250
Wow, it's Cream Mushrooms!

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.980
Wow, you pop back up quick!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.920
Cream Mushroom (Mushroom) Capture Level 3

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:40.560
I've never seen natural Cream 
Mushrooms before, Sunny-san!

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.060
And these?

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:44.400
E-Ew!

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.130
It's a Vinegartopus.

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:48.100
Octopusauce "Vinegartopus" (Molluscan 
Beast) Capture Level < 1

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.640
A seasoning octopus wandering 
through the thick forest...

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.470
It's one type of Octopusauce!

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:54.610
A Vinegartopus shoots out a vinegar sauce!

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:57.210
Beauty: -100! Gross Out: 50,000!

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:03.650
This Worcester sauce-shooting Worcestopus,

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.650
and a salsa sauce-shooting Tacocto!

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:09.420
There's also a Soy Saucetopus that'll 
go well with the Cream Mushrooms!

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:12.890
W-Why did I have to get 
blown off with <i>this</i> guy?

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:22.270
Dom (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 19

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:24.870
The color of the trees... 
Is this the White Forest?

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:27.910
This island has more forests with 
beasts in them than anywhere!

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.910
And we've been blown into 
a real annoying part!

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:34.180
But as long as I'm with you, Toriko, 
I don't care where I'm blown off to!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:36.480
I have no choice!

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:45.390
Bear Pig (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 14

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:48.760
Endorphin Smoke!

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:55.700
Be good boys and go to sleep!

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:59.040
Please don't bother my 
time together with Toriko!

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:02.540
Balogg (Avian Beast) Capture Level 16

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:08.380
They keep coming! We'll break through!

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:09.250
Right!

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:13.420
I didn't plan on entering this forest...

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:15.820
Are Komatsu and Sunny safe?

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:20.460
It didn't look like Terry or Tina got 
hit by the Rock Drum's attack, though.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:24.630
It's hard to communicate...

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:27.700
It's extremely difficult to approach him...

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:31.700
Just kidding, just kidding!

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:40.380
That's...!

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:43.950
The one from the Puffer Whale cavern!

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.260
What's that?

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:57.760
Am I gonna have to fight them all?

00:06:57.760 --> 00:06:59.730
Things can't get much worse than this...

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:03.200
Alone together with Toriko, without 
that Tina chick in the way!

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:06.470
For me, things can't get much better!

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:09.170
I don't got a choice...

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:11.840
Rin, shoot some BF over to me!

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.140
But...

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:15.280
I'm just going to intimidate them.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:17.450
But dilute it by a factor of 100.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.820
If it's too dense, I might lose my senses.

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:23.720
Actually, I wouldn't mind if 
Toriko lost control at all!

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:25.590
If that happened, I'd be all...

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:28.190
After you shoot, take cover immediately.

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:31.230
Aww... But I don't wanna 
leave your side, Toriko...

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.970
Okay, do it! Shoot the BF!

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:37.340
Right... But you sure you'll be okay?

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:40.040
BF is designed to be used on the beasts...

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:43.170
It puts a big strain on the 
nerves and body, I'm sure.

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:45.910
I'm sure I can handle it. Shoot it, Rin!

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:49.510
Then, here we go! Battle Fragrance!

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:57.660
Stand back, Rin!

00:07:57.920 --> 00:08:00.330
This is dangerous!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:04.000
Toriko's wild nature is out of control?!

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:35.360
That was close... I almost 
went and attacked them.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.700
Yeah... BF is dangerous, that's for sure.

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:39.760
Toriko...

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:42.770
Why didn't you go and attack me?!

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:46.370
It doesn't look like we'll 
be able to avoid battle...

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.350
That's...

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:57.180
An Obasaurus.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:09:00.120
A beast that loyally follows orders

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:02.750
from someone with strength 
it calls its master.

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:06.590
Well, until someone stronger 
than that owner appears, anyway!

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:07.790
Obasaurus (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 28

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:12.360
I bet that its owner is a GT Robot.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.830
He must have been ordered to slow us down.

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:18.170
I can get a glimpse of the 
ability of that GT Robot

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:21.270
by the fact that it didn't 
run from my intimidation.

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:27.780
These knives aren't bad 
at all. Quite beautiful.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:29.910
Thanks...

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:32.080
Not you, the knives!

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:35.690
R-Right... But it still makes me happy.

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:37.390
More than if it were myself.

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:40.730
The Soy Saucetopus...

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:43.560
Emits the highest quality soy 
sauce from its icky mouth...

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:45.000
An icky octopus, indeed.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:48.630
But you can get an even more 
rich and mature soy sauce

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:52.200
from an icky adult than that icky young one.

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:57.010
Right... But I'm not able to catch 
a fully grown Soy Saucetopus.

00:09:57.010 --> 00:09:59.510
Well, they are Capture Level 5.

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:00.780
Even though they're <i>icky</i>.

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:04.250
You've really been saying "icky" 
too much since we landed here.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:09.950
Smells lovely!

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:13.460
The aroma of the Cream Mushrooms 
grows deeper and stronger

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.560
when combined with the 
fragrance of the soy sauce!

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:18.060
Sunny-san, let's eat them together!

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:19.630
Thank you for this food.

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:24.670
Amazing! A creamy texture, and this smell!

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:27.370
Naturally growing ones are 
a cut above, they are!

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:31.410
I just caught this fully 
grown Soy Saucetopus.

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:33.950
That will go better with the Cream Mushrooms.

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:35.480
R-Right...

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:37.280
Thank you very much.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:40.220
Your name is Komatsu, yes?

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:42.890
Even though we've been blown 
into this dangerous area,

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:46.490
you run around like a little child 
when you see high-level ingredients...

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:48.090
Icky to the max!

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:53.460
But for some reason, you carry some 
beautiful cooking tools with you.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.770
The moment you held it in your 
hand, the ingredients shone...

00:10:56.770 --> 00:10:59.600
You prepared them all in a flash!

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:03.140
To put it simply... When 
you are cooking, you are...

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:05.040
...beautiful.

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:07.010
Thanks.

00:11:07.010 --> 00:11:09.610
Oh, sorry... I just licked your cheek.

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:10.450
What?

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:13.690
Nothing. Hurry up and 
eat the Cream Mushrooms.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:16.720
Did you just do something to me?!

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:21.290
For the Legendary Battle Wolf to run away,

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:23.660
that black one must be something else!

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:31.140
He's not running... He's 
searching for Toriko!

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:33.710
He remembers the direction 
Toriko was blown off towards,

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:36.070
and is following the scent, right?

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:39.840
A wolf's brain is almost three 
times the size of a dog's...

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:43.580
And a Battle Wolf has one 
twice the size of that!

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:46.480
He's trying to warn Toriko...

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:48.290
Warn him that it's here!

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:57.430
We have indications that 3 GT 
Robots have already entered

00:11:57.430 --> 00:12:00.630
the Regal Highlands where 
the Regal Mammoths live.

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:07.140
But it's the black one that came later 
which is more dangerous than those guys.

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:11.180
It's the same one that showed up in 
the Puffer Whale Cavern Lagoon, yes?

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:13.880
Yes. Judging by the security camera footage,

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:16.850
it is thought to be controlled 
by the same person.

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:20.250
Well, even if I left now, I wouldn't make it.

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:23.690
Right now I should devote my attention 
to this little Regal-chan.

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:24.620
But...

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:28.930
If we end up fighting 
him, we'll need it, yes?

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:30.700
The Jewel Meat?

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:35.200
Inside a Regal Mammoth there is 
a special, ultimate cut of meat

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:38.200
that embodies the taste of fillet, sirloin,

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:41.610
and even organs like the heart, and liver...

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:46.940
A food so prized it has been called a 
"food treasure" since ancient times...

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:49.580
In the past they were cut 
apart and everything was used,

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:52.480
but lately only the Jewel Meat is taken out.

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:55.190
That way, we can take the 
meat again and again.

00:12:55.190 --> 00:12:59.990
Although it does take decades for 
it to grow again once harvested!

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:05.200
Sunny, your Knocking was too shallow!

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:08.600
Little Regal-chan, be patient 
just a little longer!

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:13.370
We'll return you to your parents 
right after we get that Jewel Meat!

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:16.570
What? Did you just call me handsome?

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:19.280
No, it did not!

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:26.080
However, it was a mistake to 
capture the child first...

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:29.850
I bet the parent is in a frenzy 
searching for the child.

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:32.890
The most tricky one would be...

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:43.400
You're in my way!

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:46.770
Now then... Where's that Regal Mammoth?

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:08.630
Obasaurus... I can definitely see 
why it deserves Capture Level 28!

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:20.770
Toriko!

00:14:23.810 --> 00:14:27.080
I took a lot of damage at the Coliseum...

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:30.380
I could manage this guy 
if I was fully recovered,

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:36.790
but if I take another direct 
hit, I'm in real trouble.

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:57.110
I don't have the power to 
avoid its attacks any longer!

00:14:57.110 --> 00:14:57.880
Toriko!

00:14:57.880 --> 00:15:01.510
I have no choice... Rin, 
shoot me with BF again!

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:05.150
But just once took a toll on your body...

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:07.120
Doing it twice will be really dangerous!

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:09.120
Please, Rin!

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:14.330
B-Battle Fragrance!

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:20.100
Mature soy sauce from a Soy Saucetopus, 
Cream Mushrooms, and a bunch else!

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:22.770
I've got a bunch of gifts for 
the Hotel when I get back!

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:27.070
Matsu, taking ingredients out of 
the Biotope yourself isn't allowed.

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:28.240
It's a serious crime.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:30.510
What?! Really?

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:32.840
Man, what a huge shock...

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:34.780
Is that Gourmet Case the latest model?

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:38.050
Yes. It's a portable type, the Takeout 1000.

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:40.750
It has the preservation data 
for 1000 ingredients in it.

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:44.220
A Gourmet Case that can keep things 
hot, cold, or even vacuum-sealed!

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:47.430
It has a cute silhouette, and it's beautiful.

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:50.560
Fine. I think it'll be okay if you 
take ingredients back in that.

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:52.430
So, it's okay if you put them in something?

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:54.630
It's okay because it's beautiful!

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:56.800
And it's okay because I say it's okay!

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.100
Isn't that right, Matsu?

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:01.540
Is that so? And, the serious crime part...?

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:02.810
We're here, Matsu!

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:06.080
When did my name turn into Matsu, I wonder?

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:07.780
It's the Ancient Marsh.

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:09.650
Ancient... Marsh?

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:12.220
A great number of ancient 
Gourmet Ingredients sleep here.

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:14.250
It is nicknamed the "Food Museum".

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:15.720
Mad Dragon (Pterosaurian 
Beast) Capture Level 13

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:19.720
Swamp Eel (Piscine Beast) Capture Level 18

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:19.860
It's a Swamp Eel!

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:23.530
A Snake Leech!

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.060
Snake Leech (Molluscan 
Beast) Capture Level 23

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:26.100
Gator Shark (Piscine Beast) Capture Level 27

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.130
What just happened?

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.500
I don't even know...

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:33.100
The struggle for Gourmet Ingredients 
means the food chain is thriving.

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:35.610
Well, maybe I should join in myself.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:39.440
Into this food chain battle...

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:42.310
Join in? Then, we're crossing this marsh?

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:43.820
Of course.

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:47.190
S-Swimming?

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:49.350
Who the hell would swim in that swamp?!

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:51.320
Cold!

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.890
Cold?

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:55.630
What the... I'm floating!

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:57.500
It's called surface tension.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:59.930
I'd rather not touch the dirty mud,

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:02.670
but it's better than 
touching it with my body.

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:04.670
Your feelers are on the marsh?

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:09.210
Surface tension... So, like a water strider?

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:12.480
It's a bottomless marsh, so you 
need to be careful not to sink.

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:14.410
Plus, the marsh is only 5 or 6 degrees.

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:16.310
You can tell the temperature as well?

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:19.180
My hairs have different senses.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:21.390
The blue hair can measure temperature.

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:24.360
It can sense temperatures lower 
than the skin, my Cold Points.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:27.790
Pink can sense very hot 
temperatures, my Hot Points.

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:32.230
Green can tell whether it's being 
pushed or pulled, my Pressure Points.

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:35.330
White has the ability to 
sense pain, my Pain Points.

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:37.900
They're different colors 
based on how you use them?

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:39.000
Easy to tell that way, right?

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:39.700
Yeah...

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:41.610
What's the matter?

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:43.370
There's something odd about the Marsh.

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:47.210
I can hardly see any of the Gourmet 
Ingredients that should live here.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:49.910
And even more, there are too 
few beasts in the actual marsh.

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:57.620
Whoa there, what is this?!

00:17:58.620 --> 00:17:59.660
How awful...

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:02.190
Is this the work of the 
Gourmet Corp.'s GT Robots?

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:04.430
Why would they do something like that?

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:08.230
They are trying to take control of all 
the Gourmet Ingredients in the world!

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:10.000
They'll use any means necessary.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:13.910
They do whatever they want, and 
collect Gourmet Ingredients...

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:16.910
They must be trying to raise the level 
of their Gourmet Cells all at once.

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:18.980
Gourmet Cells?

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:21.410
Chief Mansom also mentioned those...

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:22.950
What exactly are they?

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:24.880
A special type of Super Cell.

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:27.020
Gourmet Cells can be gathered

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:29.820
from a Mystical Jellyfish that 
lives in the depths of the ocean.

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:32.860
They have an incredible life 
force and regenerative ability.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:36.930
If you combine Gourmet 
Cells with other tissue,

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:39.860
you enhance that tissue's 
functionality miraculously!

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:42.030
You can make a tasty apple tastier,

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:44.370
or tasty milk tastier.

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:48.770
Matsu, what do you think happens if 
you combine Gourmet Cells with humans?

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:52.740
You become superhuman, with 
incredible overwhelming power!

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:57.380
Furthermore, the more tasty things 
you eat, the more you level up!

00:18:57.380 --> 00:19:00.020
The more delicious things 
you eat, the more...?

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:04.360
For your information, Toriko, Coco, and 
I have Gourmet Cells in our bodies.

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:07.230
As do the Chief, and Rin.

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:08.990
Then you're all...

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:11.600
Of course, the risks are huge.

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:15.200
If the fusion doesn't go well, and you 
lose to the power of the Gourmet Cells,

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:17.470
in the worst case scenario, you would die.

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:19.570
Well, I think I understand the secret

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:22.070
behind your and Toriko-san's 
monstrous strength, Sunny-san.

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:24.810
Call it "beautiful" strength! Monstrous, ha!

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:37.290
Toriko, you've reached your limit!

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:39.460
Toriko, your body can't take it!

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:41.730
Super Relaxation!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:47.270
Super Relaxation! Nice timing, there.

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:50.000
I was just about to 
completely lose all reason!

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:51.470
Toriko...

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:53.470
Bad timing...

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:56.140
I should have shot him 
after he lost all reason.

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:59.180
Wait, Toriko... Are you okay?

00:19:59.180 --> 00:20:00.280
Yeah...

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:02.780
I've lost a lot of stamina after the battle

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:06.280
with the GT Robot in the 
Coliseum and those two BFs.

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:09.990
I'm at about 50-60% of my healthy strength.

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:11.990
I've got to eat something, or else...

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:15.860
I'll never make it to the Regal Highlands!

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:19.730
The Obasaurus?

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:23.270
That's it! You lost from my intimidation!

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:25.570
That means I'm its new owner!

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:28.870
Sunny-san...

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:33.580
If the Gourmet Corp. is collecting the 
most delicious ingredients, then...?

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:36.950
Yes. Of course, they also have Gourmet Cells.

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:40.720
And they were always a crude, 
icky, evil organization!

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:45.360
With the Gourmet Cells, they're even 
more evil and icky! 100 times ickier!

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:47.860
Well, not like I care one way or the other.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:50.230
Not some stupid battle with the Gourmet Corp.

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:52.560
But, it's just too cruel...

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:56.100
It wasn't used for food, or Knocked...

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:59.440
It just had its life taken 
away, for no reason!

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:03.680
For me, I really don't care 
about fighting the Gourmet Corp.

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:08.780
But it's no laughing matter when 
things as ugly as this happen...

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:13.620
It's no laughing matter, Gourmet Corp.!

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:22.030
Toriko, where in the world did you go?

00:21:26.460 --> 00:21:30.970
The Devils are waiting for us 
in front of the Regal Highlands.

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:34.010
We have to get through this, first.

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:37.410
The land where Devils frolic... 
The Devils' Playground!

00:21:45.350 --> 00:21:51.060
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:57.330
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:58.030 --> 00:22:04.570
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:09.510
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:22:10.740 --> 00:22:14.580
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.950
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:22.420
on a journey with no end!

00:22:24.290 --> 00:22:27.390
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:27.390 --> 00:22:30.530
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:30.530 --> 00:22:36.570
amid the waves of time.

00:22:39.870 --> 00:22:41.670
Gourmet News!

00:22:42.740 --> 00:22:44.440
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:51.450
Cream Mushroom (Mushroom) Capture Level 3

00:22:44.740 --> 00:22:47.180
It's the season for Cream Mushrooms,

00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:50.550
but shipments from the No. 1 Biotope 
have been suddenly shut off,

00:22:50.550 --> 00:22:55.820
and counterfeit Cream Mushrooms, Cream 
Pinecones, have been making the rounds.

00:22:51.450 --> 00:22:52.850
Cream Mushroom (Mushroom) Capture Level < 1

00:22:52.850 --> 00:22:55.520
Cream Pinecone (Burr) Capture Level < 1

00:22:55.820 --> 00:22:58.820
They smell like mushrooms, 
and taste so creamy!

00:22:58.820 --> 00:23:02.890
I sure hope the shipments of 
Cream Mushrooms start up again!

00:23:02.890 --> 00:23:04.860
And now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:08.770
It's a game where your life is on the line.

00:23:08.770 --> 00:23:11.570
Depending on the route you chose, you can end up in heaven or hell!

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:13.600
You walk the road known as "primal instinct!"

00:23:14.040 --> 00:23:17.110
The Devils' Game! Clear the Devils' Playground!

00:23:17.110 --> 00:23:19.310
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
